{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0632_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0632_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3744a01aad699160c3662e1ac8dd54995ad5b0c9086776df92a09475703a80f3", "ja": "（今日はアイドルたちによる肝試し企画。撮影は無事\n終わり、トリを務めた志保が戻ってきたのだが……）", "zh": "（今天是偶像们参加的试胆企划。拍摄顺利结束，担任压轴的志保回来了，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0632_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0632_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "a9ee70b90218b573bcba56244496924326b1c2fe4fffffebdf0543a225636b6e", "ja": "はぁ……番組的には、この方が盛り上がるとわかって\nますけど……。放送を見るのが、少し憂鬱です。", "zh": "唉……我知道从节目效果来说，这样更能炒热气氛……可是，一想到要看播出内容，就有点郁闷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0632_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0632_1002_p", "source_sha256": "464791edf4cb15522936ef1bdcb7716f1016695df8d8db1629fe96c0baecd9b1", "ja": "撮れ高はバッチリだと思うけど。\nそれなら、みんなで放送を見るのはどうだ？", "zh": "我觉得节目效果肯定很棒。\n那大家一起看节目怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0632_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0632_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "c39e4f7fa180ab99fa09294e03e56faebe86c4c4f29df5ef0a79f9fa13e0b187", "ja": "……そうですね。ちょっと、みんなに聞いてみます。\n残ってる人、いましたよね？", "zh": "……好吧。我去问问大家。\n还有人没走，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0632_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0632_1004_p", "source_sha256": "bf421ec1ec80fa8d2be41a401e75b63a26d26d84e0686d00c2ded3f697c0ffa8", "ja": "いや、志保が最後だぞ？　先に戻ってきたみんなは\n支度を済ませて、車で待ってるよ。", "zh": "不，志保是最后一个哦？先回来的大家\n已经收拾好，在车里等着了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0632_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0632_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "1fadba9e72f1c1989544895a50ab0a444d4b748f16ac7874884fd80106756e0c", "ja": "えっ？　そんなはずは……。\n廊下の奥から、話し声がしてましたけど……。", "zh": "咦？不应该是这样啊……可是我听见走廊深处传来了说话声……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0632_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0632_1006_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0632_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0632_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "f7eaa19eac300c6965d72210398a6bc47c825c85deb8cc28d541e85eb0e6dc8b", "ja": "っ……！\nまさか、ほ、本物の幽霊……？", "zh": "呃……！\n难道说，真、真正的幽灵……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0632_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0632_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "453e78b440a31a5f831ab7bfb7317143698a6fd865ed3ded56defdb7c95f5ee9", "ja": "……あ、あの{$P$}さん。\nしばらくの間、近くにいてください。絶対ですよ……。", "zh": "……那、那个{$P$}先生。\n请暂时待在我身边。一定要哦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0632_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0632_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6446e0f8af74e733e4b2559870dd0e1827d8dfa4c0a76446c3d6e6ef3e5b7ea7", "ja": "（あとで確認したところ、アイドル達もスタッフさんも\n外にいたらしい。志保が聞いた声は、一体……）", "zh": "（后来确认了一下，偶像们和工作人员似乎也都在外面。志保听到的声音，究竟是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
